 "body": [
  {
   "_key": "en",
   "_type": "object",
   "value": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000001",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000000",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Facts"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000003",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "About The Hotel"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000b",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Wow, the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000005"
       ],
       "text": "Sandrose Hotel"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " sounds like an epic spot to unwind and soak up the desert vibes! Nestled right at the edge of the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000008"
       ],
       "text": "Bahariya Oasis"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", about 360 kilometers southwest of Cairo, it’s like a little paradise for those bitten by the wanderlust bug, wouldn’t you agree?"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000005",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://www.sandrose-hotel-baharia.com/",
       "newTab": true
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-post-151997-en",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000d",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Imagine kicking back by the pool after a day of desert adventures—just floating there, the sky above stretching endlessly, painted with the warm hues of a desert sunset. What more could you want? The hotel itself seems like a blend of modern comforts and traditional charm. I love that it has a courtyard where you can chill and share stories with fellow travelers, kind of like a modern bedouin gathering spot."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000012",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "And let’s talk about the adventures that await! Whether it’s a jeep safari through the sweeping landscapes of the Black Desert, a trek to the ethereal Crystal Mountain, or exploring the otherworldly "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000010",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000f"
       ],
       "text": "White Desert,"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000011",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " it sounds like the Sandrose Hotel is the perfect launchpad for all sorts of epic journeys. Plus, the idea of organizing your own safari trips—by jeep, camel, or on foot—adds such a personal touch to exploring, don’t you think?"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/guide/farafra-oasis",
       "newTab": false
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000014",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000013",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "The fact that the hotel offers all these modern amenities—like air conditioning, WiFi, and a restaurant serving regional dishes—means you can explore the wilds of the desert by day and return to comfort by night. Peace, relaxation, and a touch of adventure—truly, the Sandrose Hotel seems like a hidden gem in the heart of Egypt’s desert oasis. Are you thinking about heading there for your next adventure, or just dreaming about desert escapes?"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
